\":\"7p\",\"red\":false,\"orientation\":\"upright\"},{\"occurrenceId\":\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01152\",\"code\":\"8p\",\"red\":false,\"orientation\":\"upright\"},{\"occurrenceId\":\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01153\",\"code\":\"8p\",\"red\":false,\"orientation\":\"upright\"},{\"occurrenceId\":\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01154\",\"code\":\"4z\",\"red\":false,\"orientation\":\"upright\"},{\"occurrenceId\":\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01155\",\"code\":\"4z\",\"red\":false,\"orientation\":\"upright\"}]},{\"figureId\":\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:b0940:figure\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:b0940\"],\"sourceOccurrenceIds\":[\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01156\"],\"kind\":\"mahjong-example\",\"transcription\":\"2m\",\"unknowns\":[],\"caption\":\"原文内联牌列\",\"sourceNotes\":[],\"tiles\":[{\"occurrenceId\":\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01156\",\"code\":\"2m\",\"red\":false,\"orientation\":\"upright\"}]},{\"figureId\":\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:b0943:figure\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:b0943\"],\"sourceOccurrenceIds\":[\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01157\"],\"kind\":\"mahjong-example\",\"transcription\":\"8p\",\"unknowns\":[],\"caption\":\"原文内联牌列\",\"sourceNotes\":[],\"tiles\":[{\"occurrenceId\":\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01157\",\"code\":\"8p\",\"red\":false,\"orientation\":\"upright\"}]},{\"figureId\":\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:b0947:figure\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:b0947\"],\"sourceOccurrenceIds\":[\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01158\"],\"kind\":\"mahjong-example\",\"transcription\":\"题意：是否碰上家刚切出的2s？左侧牌河末张蓝色高亮的2s是本次鸣牌判断的对象。\\n下方自己的手牌，从左至右：4m 5m 5m（赤）6m 7m 2s 2s 4s 5s 5s（赤）6s 7s 9s，共13张，均正向显示；没有另行分开的摸入牌。\\n牌河按画面位置记录，保留各排、列的排列关系：\\n下方牌河：第一排从左至右为1p 5z 3z 2z 1m 2m；第二排在第一排左端下方，从左至右为4z 9m。牌面均正向。\\n上方牌河：靠近中央牌墙的一排，从左至右为[风牌未辨明] 7z 4z 9s 1s 3z；其上一排与右端对齐，从左至右为1m 5z 6z。牌面相对观者倒置。\\n左侧牌河：靠近中央的一列，从上至下为1s 9s 7z 2p 8p 7s；其左侧一列与上端对齐，从上至下为4z 7s 2s。最后的2s以蓝色高亮。牌面相对观者顺时针旋转90°。\\n右侧牌河：靠近中央的一列，从上至下为[风牌未辨明] 3z 7z 9m 9s 9m；其右侧一列与下端对齐，从上至下为6z 6z。牌面相对观者逆时针旋转90°。\\n其余三家的隐手分别位于画面上方、左侧边缘和右侧边缘，各13张，只有牌背或侧面可见，具体牌面未知；这些是隐手，不是中央牌墙。画面没有可见副露。\\n中央上方可见一段双层牌墙，上层从画面左至右有7个牌位，第3个牌位翻开5s作为宝牌指示牌，其余牌位背面朝上。\\n中央显示：南二局，剩余36张，本场数0、立直供托0；座位标记为下方西家、左侧南家、上方东家、右侧北家。中央另有两枚骰子，点数未能可靠辨认。\\n四角信息栏：左上“中流，28000（+2000）”；右上“中流，31000（+5000）”；左下“平民，26000，第3名”；右下“中流，15000（−11000）”。\\n右侧另有一个橙色矩形标记，其黑色字形未能可靠辨认。\",\"unknowns\":[\"上方牌河靠近中央牌墙的一排，画面最左端风牌的确切牌码未能可靠辨认。\",\"右侧牌河靠近中央的一列，最上端风牌的确切牌码未能可靠辨认。\",\"上方、左侧和右侧三家隐手的具体牌面未显示。\",\"中央两枚骰子的各自点数未能可靠辨认。\",\"右侧橙色矩形标记内的黑色字形未能可靠辨认。\"],\"caption\":\"问题60：是否碰上家刚切出的2s？左侧蓝色高亮的2s是此次鸣牌判断的对象。\",\"sourceNotes\":[\"原图与最近邻放大图是同一画面的两种视图，不构成额外牌张或额外出现次数。\",\"画面四周及下方有黑色区域，部分界面边缘被遮挡或裁切；未据此推定隐藏内容。\"]},{\"figureId\":\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:b0953:figure\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:b0953\"],\"sourceOccurrenceIds\":[\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01159\"],\"kind\":\"mahjong-example\",\"transcription\":\"1p\",\"unknowns\":[],\"caption\":\"原文内联牌列\",\"sourceNotes\":[],\"tiles\":[{\"occurrenceId\":\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01159\",\"code\":\"1p\",\"red\":false,\"orientation\":\"upright\"}]},{\"figureId\":\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:b0954:figure\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:b0954\"],\"sourceOccurrenceIds\":[\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01160\",\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01161\",\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01162\",\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01163\",\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01164\",\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01165\",\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01166\",\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01167\",\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01168\",\"modern-yabejp-ja:chapter06-exercise003:i01169\",\"modern-y